silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_08_process_leg_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'ProcessLegYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Process Leg', the process_leg_arrow SleepProcess_7h -> MittensColimitApex: the daily sleep behavior leg; monic (this specific process instance is unique to Mittens in this diagram) but not epic.; also, In 'Process Leg', the bfo_process_type_arrow records that SleepProcess_7h is typed under BFO:0000015 (process); BFO:0000015 is shared by all process nodes, so not monic." .
